         Running Bound: the first key, after the scan's quals
         Batch Format: postgres
         Kernel Steps: 0
         Fallback Steps: 0
         Input: batches
         ->  Vec Seq Scan on public.so
               Output: k, ctid
               Filter: ((1000 / (so.id - 29990)) > '-1000'::integer)
               Batch Format: postgres
               Vector Quals: 1 of 1
               Kernel Steps: 3
               Fallback Steps: 0
               Source: heap's pages
(20 rows)

